{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>I will set in the wilderness cedar, acacia.</b> Defective [of] vav: cedar and acacia, like שמש ירח עמד (Habakkuk 3:11)." "<b>Fir and cypress.</b> Trees, and all of these are around rivers, for in any place that lacks water they will not grow."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:23.080613878Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}